# Adapters

This product’s adapters are `Journeys.DAL` and `Journeys.Infra*`.

Follow `.cursor/rules/dal-adapters.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/infra-adapters.mdc`. Do not put campaign/journey business rules in adapters.
